      "text": "### ◈ AZOTH & Kokoro Neural Voice\n\n**Core IP**: Embodied Braille & ASCII AI Agent + Real-Time Neural Speech\n- **Tech**: 60FPS articulated facial rig in pure Unicode U+2800 Braille + Bayer 8x8 dither\n- **Voice**: 54-voice Kokoro ONNX TTS (:9394) + real-time phoneme viseme lip-sync\n- **Status**: 100% genuine in-browser utility, low-latency duplex audio\n- **Verdict**: **NEXT LEVEL (10/10)** — Flagship sovereign AI avatar"
