      "x": -1140,
      "y": -900,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "### 🌐 ZothNet Sovereign Mesh (:42069 / :9900)\n\n**Core IP**: Decentralized zero-broker encrypted mesh network\n- **Tech**: Raw UDP datagram mesh (port 42069) + Ed25519 identity + ChaCha20-Poly1305\n- **Surfaces**: Go binary, Android client, Web console on :9900\n- **Status**: Actively running daemon on host (PID 2240014)\n- **Verdict**: **NEXT LEVEL (10/10)** — Sovereign off-grid communication backbone"
