      "text": "### 💻 ZothOS GNU/Linux (Trixie Hybrid)\n\n**Status**: **100% PRODUCTION READY**\n- **Base**: Debian 13 (Trixie) + KDE Plasma 6 + XFCE fallback\n- **Multiboot**: Dualboot synchronized with Parrot OS on SATA SSD\n- **ISO**: Production-ready `zothos-3.3-amd64.iso` (8.8 GB)\n- **Verdict**: **ROCK-SOLID OS WORKSTATION (10/10)**"
