      "text": "### 🔬 DeepSearch Research Agent & Hermes Lab\n\n**Gap Analysis**: **STALE PROMPTS (60% Complete)**\n- **Current**: Research pipeline scripts in `hermes-laboratory/`\n- **Missing**: Needs migration from older OpenAI endpoint to local Ollama / Gemini 3.8\n- **Priority**: Medium — Upgrade to local Qwen 2.5 / NousCoder\n- **Action**: Update `hermes-laboratory/server.py` with modern provider bus"
