      "x": 1040,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "### 💰 Zoth-Bounty Automated Security Triage\n\n**Gap Analysis**: **UNFINISHED INTEGRATION (55% Complete)**\n- **Current**: HackerOne / Bugcrowd report template generator in place\n- **Missing**: Direct hook into Zoth-OSINT scan outputs for 1-click POC generation\n- **Priority**: Medium — Synergizes with HexStrike and OSINT\n- **Action**: Wire OSINT target findings into `zoth-bounty/` report builder"
