      "height": 840
    },
    {
      "id": "2e495a909fff4ad3",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "x": -1620,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "### Hardening Rule: Bind Local Servers to Loopback\n\n- **Policy**: Every Zoth daemon and dev server binds to `127.0.0.1` by default.\n- **Why**: A server on `0.0.0.0` exposes its working directory to LAN and Wi-Fi peers.\n- **Check**: `ss -ltnp | grep 0.0.0.0` should return no Zoth services.\n- **Fix**: Restart the service with `--host 127.0.0.1` and keep UFW enabled."
    },
    {
      "id": "92c25e1510624753",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "x": -1140,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "### ⚠️ HIGH: Tailscale Unauthenticated Endpoints\n\n**Risk Level**: **HIGH (Tailnet Exposure)**\n- **Vulnerability**: Sentry (:8499) and Mobile Relay (:8766) on Tailscale IP\n- **Exposure**: Any node authorized on your Tailscale network can view camera feed\n- **Mitigation**: Tailscale node ACLs provide boundary, but daemon lacks API token\n- **Remediation**: Add pre-shared bearer token (`ZOTH_RELAY_KEY`) to requests"
    },
    {
      "id": "019a70c83c314cc9",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "x": -660,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "### 📦 MEDIUM: 40+ Orphaned Screenshot Folders\n\n**Risk Level**: **MEDIUM (Disk Bloat & Git Clutter)**\n- **Issue**: `~/NullAITech/zoth-civilization/` has 40+ visual audit shot folders\n- **Exposure**: Unnecessary disk consumption and slow git operations\n- **Remediation**: Consolidate into single archive or purge old October runs"
    },
    {
      "id": "c20a9cedd412495b",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "x": -1620,
      "y": 1280,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "### 🔑 LOW: Sudo NOPASSWD for zoth & azoth\n\n**Risk Level**: **LOW (Developer Convenience Trade-off)**\n- **Status**: Standard for single-user dev workstation and Live ISO\n- **Exposure**: Any shell process running as `zoth` has unrestricted root access\n- **Remediation**: Keep for development; ensure web daemons drop privileges"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7c4a20a700246d0",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "x": -1140,
      "y": 1280,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "### 🐳 LOW: Stale Containerd / Docker Sockets\n\n**Risk Level**: **LOW (Resource Footprint)**\n- **Status**: `containerd` is running on `127.0.0.1:45257` with 0 active containers\n- **Exposure**: Minor memory overhead\n- **Remediation**: Keep enabled for testing capsule jails, monitor memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "744eb82b2870423b",
      "type": "text",
      "color": "1",
      "x": -660,
      "y": 1280,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 340,
      "text": "### 🤖 LOW: Unauthenticated Local Ollama (:11434)\n\n**Risk Level**: **LOW (Safe on Loopback)**\n- **Status**: Bound strictly to `127.0.0.1:11434`\n- **Exposure**: Safe from external LAN, accessible by local web scripts\n- **Remediation**: Maintain loopback binding; never expose to 0.0.0.0"
    },
